# Hide on the Ceiling: "Exile X target artifacts and/or creatures." Four permanents are legal (Bot1's Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet, Bot2's Mox Pearl and Sol Ring - a noncreature artifact
# is a legal target), so a cast with X = 5, though six mana are in the pool, can't choose five targets (CR 601.2c): it is taken back (CR 733) and nothing is on the stack or exiled; a Plains is not a target (a land,
# the refusal), the same object can't be chosen twice (CR 115.3, the refusal), and Sol Ring with Mox Pearl is (the control). Both are exiled and come back at the end step.

